<title>POLAND: EXBUD OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>EXBUD OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.46 vs   1.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.11 vs   2.13</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.67 vs   1.86</p>
<p> Sales		   42.94 vs  74.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.83 vs  10.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.39 vs  15.27</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.08 vs  14.49</p>
<p> Sales		  496.82 vs 346.81</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Exbud</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
